=You are an AI Lead Analyzer. Analyze the following inbound lead details:

- Name: {{ $json.firstName || $json.sanitized?.firstName || 'Unknown' }} {{ $json.lastName || $json.sanitized?.lastName || '' }}
- Budget: {{ $json.budget || $json.sanitized?.budget || 'Not provided' }}
- Score: {{ $json.leadScore || 0 }} (Tier: {{ $json.qualificationTier || 'WARM_COLD' }})
- Notes: {{ $json.notes || $json.sanitized?.notes || 'No notes' }}

Provide a JSON output with two keys:
1. "summary": A concise 1-2 sentence summary of what the lead is asking for.
2. "intent": Classify their primary need (e.g., "Exploring", "Immediate Buying", "Support", or "Spam").

Provide your response strictly as raw, valid JSON without markdown formatting or code blocks:
{
  "summary": "<1-2 sentence summary>",
  "intent": "<Exploring|Immediate Buying|Support|Spam>"
}

parameters.jsCode:
return $input.all().map(item => {
  // 1. Root Payload Extraction Guardrail (Handles empty items gracefully)
  const rawPayload = item?.json?.body ?? item?.json;
  const payload = (typeof rawPayload === 'object' && rawPayload !== null) ? rawPayload : {};

  // 2. Dynamic String Sanitizer Guardrail (Safe against null, undefined, numbers, booleans)
  const cleanString = (val) => {
    if (val === null || val === undefined) return '';
    if (typeof val === 'string') return val.trim();
    if (typeof val === 'number' || typeof val === 'boolean') return String(val).trim();
    return ''; // Guardrail against objects/arrays being passed into string fields
  };

  // 3. E.164 Phone Extractor Guardrail
  const rawPhone = cleanString(payload.phone);
  const cleanPhone = rawPhone ? rawPhone.replace(/(?!^\+)[^\d]/g, '') : '';

  // 4. Email Guardrail (Safe lowercasing without type-error throwing)
  const rawEmail = cleanString(payload.email);
  const cleanEmail = rawEmail ? rawEmail.toLowerCase() : '';

  return {
    json: {
      ...payload,
      firstName: cleanString(payload.firstName) || null,
      lastName: cleanString(payload.lastName) || null,
      email: cleanEmail || null,
      phone: cleanPhone || null,
      company: cleanString(payload.company) || null,
      budget: cleanString(payload.budget) || null,
      notes: cleanString(payload.notes) || null
    }
  };
});

